@startuml
title State machine for Ott Based System Mini Reel

[*] --> AccountCreation : Create Account

state "Account Creation" as AccountCreation {
  state "Not Logged In"
  state "Logged In"
}

state VideoWatch <<choice>>
state VideoUpload <<choice>>
state LikeVideo <<choice>>

"Logged In" --> VideoWatch
"Logged In" --> VideoUpload
"Logged In" --> LikeVideo

LikeVideo : entry / User saves a video in likes list
LikeVideo : do / Save video to user's likes list
LikeVideo : exit / User can view saved videos from likes list

VideoWatch : entry / User watches a video
VideoWatch : do / Display video content
VideoWatch : exit / User returns to main menu

VideoUpload : entry / User uploads a video
VideoUpload : do / Upload and store the video
VideoUpload : exit / User returns to main menu

DiscussionEntry : entry / User enters discussion option
DiscussionEntry : do / Navigate to discussion section
DiscussionEntry : exit / User returns to main menu

"Logged In" --> DiscussionEntry

LikeVideo --> "Logged In"
VideoWatch --> "Logged In"
VideoUpload --> "Logged In"

"Logged In" --> [*] : Logout

@enduml
